function operatingView(){return panel('Complete a first review',`<ol class="number-list"><li>Choose Synthetic planning, a snapshot, period and region.</li><li>${link('wci','inputs','Review inputs')} and add a rationale, material risks and optional deal declarations.</li><li>Save and validate the draft. Acknowledge the source exceptions.</li><li>${link('wci','review','Submit the package')}, switch to the simulated Reviewer role, and approve or return it with a reason.</li><li>${link('wci','brief','Prepare a WBR, MBR or QBR')}, record a follow-up and export Word.</li><li>Change to the next snapshot. The action register persists; review the outcome before closing an action.</li></ol>${btn('load-completed','Explore a completed sample review')}`)+panel('Decision rights & service levels',raciEditor()+`<p class="small">Review SLA: ${config.reviewSlaDays} days. Escalate overdue dependencies to ${esc(config.accountable)}. Proposed demonstration operating model; not a Stripe policy.</p><p>Definition conflict resolved: Finance and Sales retain separate bookings and recognized revenue contracts. The rejected alternative was one combined sales total.</p>`)+panel('Calendar, rules & local role configuration',`<div class="form-grid">${field('config-stale','Stale activity threshold · days',config.staleDays,'number','min="1" max="180"')}${field('config-deadline','Submission deadline',config.deadline,'date')}${field('config-sla','Review SLA · days',config.reviewSlaDays,'number','min="1" max="30"')}${select('config-accountable','Escalation owner',['Finance partner','GTM Operations','Sales manager'],config.accountable)}</div><p class="small">Calendar-year quarters; Monday week start; USD scenario currency. Fiscal-year remapping and FX conversion are not applied to these fixed fixtures.</p><div class="actions">${btn('save-config','Save configuration','','primary')}${btn('export-config','Export configuration JSON')}<label class="button">Import JSON<input id="import-config" type="file" accept="application/json" class="sr-only"></label></div><p>Configuration version ${config.version}. ${link('data','operations','View processing and usage evidence →')}</p>`);}
