function experienceView(){return panel('Professional context — provided by Renato',`<p>Commercial Excellence and GTM Operations work spanning sales performance, incentive governance, forecasting, analytics, data quality and executive decision support. More than a decade across regulated operations, healthcare, enterprise software, product, enablement and analytics; this is not a claim of ten years specifically in GTM Operations.</p>${table([{area:'AI-assisted executive reporting',contribution:'Designed the reporting workflow and validation mechanism',result:'83% reduction in weekly preparation time',basis:'Candidate-provided outcome; underlying time records are not included publicly'},{area:'Leadership review process',contribution:'Standardized the review mechanism and decision flow',result:'50% shorter review cycle',basis:'Candidate-provided outcome; independent audit evidence not provided in this portfolio'},{area:'Quota and actuals governance',contribution:'Owned rules, consolidation and validation criteria',result:'Approximately 450 sellers; up to 75% faster consolidation',basis:'Scope and qualified result reported by the candidate; not derived from this demo'},{area:'Centralized commercial cockpit',contribution:'Standardized metrics and cross-regional analysis',result:'50+ recurring users; estimated 70–85% less recurring preparation',basis:'Candidate-provided estimates; distinct from reporting and review metrics'},{area:'Conversational performance pilot',contribution:'Designed queries, validation, documentation and human review',result:'20 users over one month; typical retrieval/update from ~8–15 to ~1–3 minutes',basis:'Pilot range; no new percentage inferred'},{area:'Enablement and agile operations',contribution:'Certification, learning and operating model coordination',result:'230+ professionals enabled/certified; 600+ supported; agile model for 20+',basis:'Separate programs; do not aggregate as one project result'}],[['area','Area'],['contribution','Contribution',esc,'wrap'],['result','Reported result',esc,'wrap'],['basis','Evidence boundary',esc,'wrap']],'professional-evidence')}<p>These outcomes come from the candidate’s supplied professional brief. The reference implementation establishes technical behavior, not independent verification of career outcomes. Exact employment dates and calculation workpapers were not supplied and are not invented.</p>`)+panel('Experience progression and toolkit','<p>Regulated healthcare operations → enterprise software product operations and agile practices → global technical enablement → commercial analytics and AI performance insights → Sales Excellence and GTM Operations. This is an undated sequence of reported experience areas, not a verified employment timeline.</p><p>Professional toolkit supported by the brief: SQL, Power BI, DAX, Power Query, Python, Salesforce, Databricks, Excel, SharePoint, Power Automate, Copilot Studio and enterprise workflow tools. SQLite, the browser metric engine and this static deployment are implementation choices for the public reference project.</p>')+panel('Research translated into design',`<p>McKinsey informed the questions on selling time, prioritization and capacity. Fivetran/dbt informed stored-history and reconciliation patterns. Frappe informed opportunity actions; Promptfoo informed explicit assertions and regression evaluation. Open-source references supplied design patterns, not copied implementation or production-experience claims.</p><p><a href="${root}docs/REFERENCES.md">Read the reviewed references and application notes →</a></p>`);}
